# Sibra (Modul 6.3), after a prefix and before the suffixes most often
# used, at the end of a word. A Sibra before the repeat sign is read
# as the repeated root: buta-butaan.
# A Sibra of two letters is read after a letter only when the letter
# can end a prefix (e, r, m, n, g), so that ABRI, KTP, korban and iklan
# are not read as Sibra. After di (dots 3-4), which is not the letter
# i, the forms of a verb are listed: dikira, disukai.
