# The repeat sign (read as < by id-id-g1.utb) repeats the letters before
# it, back to the start of the word or to a hyphen, which is then
# dropped: kamus< is kamus-kamus, ber-lari< is berlari-lari. A capital
# at the start of the word is not repeated: Lagi-lagi.
